(1, 'Submit BOM for Approval', 'bom', 113, 'The triage analysis indicates that the Draft BOM BOM/00150/26-27 is stalled due to missing descriptions for components 32432 and r3434, which may cause issues during procurement and inventory management. Please update the component descriptions for 32432 and r3434 to ensure accurate and efficient procurement and inventory tracking.', 'rejected', '2026-07-16 09:47:36', 1);
