(1, 'bom', 113, 'The triage analysis indicates that the Draft BOM BOM/00150/26-27 is stalled due to missing descriptions for components 32432 and r3434, which may cause issues during procurement and inventory management. Please update the component descriptions for 32432 and r3434 to ensure accurate and efficient procurement and inventory tracking.', '2026-07-16 09:47:33', '055115efea954d6bad3983d0b989b1e9e27206fc08c1bd2e573b6a2ee21bf5d9'),
(2, 'bom', 112, 'The triage analysis indicates that the Draft BOM BOM/00146/26-27 is stalled due to component shortages, specifically a shortage of 5 units of item 9001 and 6 units of item 54323, both of which have no stock available. Please review and update the component descriptions for items 9001 and 54323 to ensure accurate identification and sourcing, and then re-run the MRP to resolve the shortages.', '2026-07-16 09:47:39', '9aa8442780176111d14de59621be056c0933750db83f3fc4517d8352ff5a210a');
