(135, 'XFORM-2627-TT-3918-OC-121', 12500, 13950, 918, 0, 1, 3, 1, '<p><strong>Transportation</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Cost of transportation from our warehouse to your designated warehouse or project site is payable extra and is not included in quoted price (unless specified)</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Packaging</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Cost of normal packaging in corrugated carton/wrapping is included in quoted price but does not cover cost of wooden crating, palletisation, weather proof packing or any other special packing or fumigation charges.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Loading/Unloading/Handling</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Cost of one time loading in our warehouse is included in quoted price cost of unloading at your designated warehouse or project site is not included in quoted price.</li>\r\n	<li>In case of unloading is included and specifically mentioned in our quote, it shall be only at ground floor level nearest to the entrance.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Unloading by Mathadi</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>Unloading by local mathadi/or any labor union member is at your cost and risk, we shall not interact/engage in any dealing with them of any kind for loading and handling of goods.</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n', '<ol>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;50% ADVANCE,40% BEFOR GLASS,10% AFTER COMPLETION (INCLUDING GST AMOUNT)</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;Payment shall be in favour of &quot;ARCON PARTITION&quot;</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;There is No retention on behalf of &quot;ARCON PARTITION&quot;</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Delay in project schedule</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;On changing of approved specification by the client</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;On delay in approval of samples,</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;On non-receipt of payment in scheduled time by the client</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;On noncompliance of site handover or any local authority or legal approval</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;Due to natural calamity, strike, traffic problem not attributed to system installer</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n', '<p><strong>Installation</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;Installation unless specifically mentioned in this offer, is not in our scope and is not included in&nbsp; &nbsp;the quoted price</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;Where installation is part of our scope same shall be specifically mentioned in our office and&nbsp; &nbsp;such installation shall not include any types of civil work whatsoever in our civil works, if any&nbsp; &nbsp;shall be scope of customer.</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;Arcon&nbsp;partition system work will start only after clearance of full site, means no part work will be done, once started Arcon partition system will finish in single trough.</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;Any changing in drawing or verbal communication at site will not be accepted until it is done on mail along with designated person only.</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;We are taking glass pannel width in partition upto 1200 mm only,if changes in above width&nbsp; &nbsp;required at site than inform us before glass measurment,if any additional cost arise from this will not be paid by us</li>\r\n	<li>GLASS WILL BE HAVING BEND UPTO 1MM TO 6MM PER MTR</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;INSTALLATION SCHEDULE IS SUBJECT TO PAYMENT</li>\r\n	<li>Delivery Schedule : 15 days after receiving PO and advance</li>\r\n	<li>Validity of Quotation: 15 Days from the date of this quotation</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n', '<ol>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;Gst is payable extra as actual, if not included in quote</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;Any other levies and taxes, if any as mandated by the statuary authorities from time to time, at time of placing of order shall be payable extra, and is not included in quoted price (unless specified)</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n', '<p><strong>Security for physical material</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>It is the responsibility of the client for security of physical material lying at site. The liability from our side ceases as soon as the acknowledged of receipt of physical material duly signed by authorized representative of client. Once the duly acknowledged received at site will not be returnable under any circumstances</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Jurisdiction</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>All disputes shall be subject to Mumbai jurisdiction only</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n', 'Default subheading Quotation P00511223344', 'Arcon Partition P00511223344', '<p>Standard memo for quotation&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 0, 'P00511223344', '3918', 'TEST TEST', NULL, NULL, 'XFORM-2627-TT-3918-OC-121', NULL, NULL, '', 'open', NULL, '', '', '', '2026-06-26', '2026-07-11');
