uly acknowledged received at site will not be returnable under any circumstances</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Jurisdiction</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>All disputes shall be subject to Mumbai jurisdiction only</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n', 'Default subheading Quotation', 'Arcon Partition', '<p>Standard memo for quotation&nbsp;</p>\r\n', 0, 'PT20011221P', '4015', 'PT20011221P System', NULL, NULL, 'XFORM-2627-PS-4015-OC-129', NULL, NULL, '', 'open', NULL, '', '', '', '2026-06-29', '2026-07-14'),
